## Unique/Notable Files

### **Files with ProjectileInvokePower (Triggered Effects)**

These files trigger special game events when projectiles hit:

```
pow_gp_arbiter_stasis_01 → StasisProjectileEffect1
pow_gp_corruptedlifedrain_01 → Corruption effects
pow_gp_ep2emptowerdrop_01 → EMP and buff effects
unsc_inf_heroodstrocket_01 → ODSTEmpBlast
```

### **Files with AllowFriendlyFire (Leadership Abilities)**

Area-of-effect abilities that affect allies:

```
pow_gp_arbiter_stasis_01
pow_gp_orbitalbombardment
pow_gp_maccannonlvl1/2/3
Many pow_proj_* files (40% of power files)
```

### **Files with Multi-Layer AOE**

Weapons with graduated damage falloff:

```xml
<AOEData>
  <Hitbox>
    <Radius>4</Radius>
    <DamageRatio>100</DamageRatio>
  </Hitbox>
  <Hitbox>
    <Radius>8</Radius>
    <DamageRatio>50</DamageRatio>
  </Hitbox>
</AOEData>
```

**Common pattern**: Inner circle (full damage) + outer circle (reduced damage)

