## Faction Behavioral Signatures

### Covenant (`cov_*`)
- **Strength**: High-damage weapons, plasma/energy focus
- **Strategy**: Mixed melee/ranged, specialized roles
- **Unique**: Cloaking mechanics, Lich mechanics, brute force
- **Example weapon priorities**: Infantry > Vehicles > Buildings

### UNSC (`unsc_*`)
- **Strength**: Versatile loadouts, balanced stats
- **Strategy**: Heavy vehicles, soldier swarms
- **Unique**: Turret varieties, mech/mantis units
- **Example**: Marines can gather supplies (resource diversity)

### Flood (`flood_*`)
- **Strength**: Assimilated enemy units, spawning structures
- **Strategy**: Unit multiplication, elite conversions
- **Unique**: Infected variants of existing units
- **Example**: flood_inf_commander_01 likely has spawning logic

### Forerunner (`for_*`)
- **Strength**: Advanced technology, beacon systems
- **Strategy**: Sentinel swarms, precision targeting
- **Unique**: Target paint mechanics, sentinel groups
- **Example**: for_air_sentinel_01 → UnscLureBeaconProc (enemy confusion)

