## Special Mechanics

### 1. Ramming Mechanics (RamState)
- Brute Rider uses specialized ram damage
- Ghost vehicle has ramming attack variant
- Lekgolo Goliath has collision-based damage
- Separate DPS calculations for ramming attacks

### 2. Lockdown Mode (cov_air_blisterback)
- Artillery mode: Limited range but high accuracy
- Normal mode: Standard attack behavior
- Mode switching via Command ability interactions

### 3. Healing/Repair Drones
- Multiple repair intensity levels (RepairOther1-4)
- Graduated work rates (0.2→0.35)
- Target preference system (damaged buildings first)

### 4. Transport Vehicles
- Support both immediate (HotDrop) and delayed (Teleport) deployment
- LoadTarget and UnloadContained actions
- RequireHavingGarrisonedSquads condition

### 5. Power Abilities
- Most support both single-target and area variants
- Level-based progression (LVL1/2/3)
- Friendship fire on/off variants

